#: admin/feedback/deactivation-feedback-form.php:31
msgid "Difficult to set up"
msgstr "ពិបាកក្នុងការដំឡើង"

#: admin/feedback/deactivation-feedback-form.php:33
msgid "What part of the setup was confusing or unclear?"
msgstr "ផ្នែកណាមួយនៃការដំឡើងដែលមានភាពច្រឡំ ឬមិនច្បាស់?"

